          "function": "cavity_geometry",
          "feature": "candidate_count_before_output_limit",
          "physical_role": "Number of void\u2011center candidates before truncation; a higher count signals a richly connected void network (0D/1D/2D) typical of many electride structures and serves as a proxy for ELF\u2011maxima counts used in literature electride descriptors."
