      "hypothesis": "Electrides can be identified by (1) a highly electropositive chemical environment (low minimum electronegativity and high alkali/alkaline\u2011earth fraction), (2) ample and open interstitial space (large mean clearance and high volume per atom), and (3) a richly connected network of interstitial sites (many ELF\u2011like void candidates).",
