          "function": "cavity_geometry",
          "feature": "candidate_count_before_output_limit",
          "physical_role": "Number of void\u2011center candidates before truncation; a larger count approximates a higher number of ELF\u2011identified interstitial basins (as described in arXiv:2605.11724) and thus a more connected void network typical of electrides."
