      "reasoning": "Features 1\u20112 encode the electropositive chemistry that stabilizes anionic electrons. Features 3\u20114 quantify the size and openness of interstitial space, which is necessary for electron confinement. Feature 5 captures the connectivity and abundance of interstitial sites, directly linked to the ELF\u2011based figure of merit used in electride screening (Z_e) as reported in the literature. Feature 6 adds a complementary measure of overall metallicity. Redundant clearance descriptors (max_clearance_A and sampled_grid_clearance_statistics_A__max) and the weak oxidation\u2011state flag have been removed, yielding a concise, physically motivated set expected to improve ROC\u2011AUC.",
